      "sourceTextSha256": "2e28eaaa3e350b8737041f96d56316c063e75a7771ad35b3f18de3623956b459",
      "text": "After breakfast, visit Lake Titicaca, at an altitude of almost 4,000 m.\n\nMore than 30 floating Uros islands lie on the lake. Built from reeds, they are home to the Aymara people.\n\nResidents fish, work in tourism, weave baskets and make furniture and boats. You can take a ride on the lake in a traditional boat accompanied by a local resident.\n\nReturn to Puno after the tour.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw2zik0k-amanda",
        "model": "GPT-6",
        "wordAbsenceReason": "The checked Word paragraph on Lake Titicaca includes Taquile but lacks this separate RU Uros-only account of 30 islands, Aymara residents and crafts; translate the assigned RU fragment without adding a Taquile visit.",
